WEBVTT

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.934
and going and you don't even
think about it.

00:15:02.958 --> 00:15:07.309
Though your own death
will take you a whole lifetime

00:15:07.333 --> 00:15:09.018
to get right.

00:15:09.042 --> 00:15:13.309
So after I gave up
on going to foreign wars,

00:15:13.333 --> 00:15:16.101
and the maturity of youth,

00:15:16.125 --> 00:15:18.434
I turned a bardic poet.

00:15:18.458 --> 00:15:23.809
And I wrote this praise song
in honor of my island mothers,

00:15:23.833 --> 00:15:27.851
who for thousands of years never faltered

00:15:27.875 --> 00:15:30.851
to cradle the dead to rest.